  },
  {
    "field": "argument_node.kind",
    "value": "theorem"
  },
  {
    "field": "argument_node.doc",
    "value": "The standard basis points are shattered by homogeneous halfspaces. Given any labelling, the ±1-weighted functional g x = ∑ i, w i * x i with w i = ±1 selected by the label realises it: g (Pi.single j 1) = w j, and 0 < w j iff the label is true."
  },
  {
    "field": "argument_node.pretty",
    "value": "∀ (n : ℕ), Shatters (Fin n → ℝ) (signClass (FLT.Halfspace.coordSpace n)) (FLT.Halfspace.basisPoints n)"
  },
